<div class="sedna-scroll" style="max-height:360px; max-width:640px">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><strong>Release notes for 4.12</strong></div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <form>
                <div class="form-section-body">
                    <div class="form-field">
                        <label class="form-label" for="sa-title">Title</label>
                        <input class="form-input" id="sa-title" type="text" value="Faster picking lists" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-field">
                        <label class="form-label" for="sa-body">Body</label>
                        <textarea class="form-input" id="sa-body" rows="12">Picking lists now open in under a second, even for a wave of two hundred orders.

The list is sorted by aisle, so a picker walks the depot once. Lines that are short in stock show at the top, with the quantity that is missing.

Printing a list no longer opens a second window. Use the print button above the list; the page prints without the sidebar and the toolbar.</textarea>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-field">
                        <label class="form-label" for="sa-audience">Shown to</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="sa-audience">
                            <option>Every user</option>
                            <option>Depot staff</option>
                            <option>Administrators</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-actions form-actions--sticky">
                    <button class="btn" type="button">Cancel</button>
                    <button class="btn btn--brand btn--solid" type="submit">Publish</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
